Package: Kmidranks
Type: Package
Title: Rank-Based Clustering with K-Midranks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nathakhun", "Wiroonsri", email = "nathakhun.wir@kmutt.ac.th",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Larry", "Goldstein", role = "aut"))
Description: Partitions multivariate observations using feature-wise ranks
    and multiple random starts. Provides Manhattan, squared Euclidean, and
    maximum-distance variants, an elbow-ratio criterion for comparing cluster
    counts, and clustering accuracy under optimal one-to-one label matching.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: clue, graphics, stats, utils
